# Review profile: evaluates what a cheap-profile run already produced. reviewer-tests
# (src/ai-agents/reviewer-tests.ts) never writes code — it reads the generated file plus the
# framework's conventions and returns a VERDICT/REASON verdict (same two-line format jira-triage's
# askYesNoWithReason uses).
#
# The whole point of this profile: review runs on a DIFFERENT, stronger model than whatever
# generated the code (cheap.env's AI_AGENTS_MODEL) — a cheap model reviewing its own output at the
# same capability tier defeats the purpose of a paranoid pass.
#
# Source before running the review step, e.g.: set -a; source ai-agents/profiles/paranoid.env; set +a

AI_REVIEW_MODEL=gemini-3.6-flash
